"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162704_1933786526834081_831610538722066432_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qb6R05MCzQoQ7kNvwEw7yyE&_nc_oc=AdnSHJZ5zCJuQf4dDCkvpheeamG2S_VDZ9aiffG2FWUGXHyMl4Y5VHS6oAKKBJqln_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0xo-8i7qTuWvPxdPtBOk7Tehn1ii6MUtPfbVh3tHsMg&oe=699AED94"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Appility", "keywords": ["appility", "accessibility", "disability", "orange", "VR"], "long_description": "What if you were to put yourself in a disabled person\u2019s shoes?\n\nAppility by Orange is an App that allows you to experience common situations encountered in the workplace by people with disabilities: impassable stairs, out-of-reach objects, etc.\n\nAppility by Orange transports you to a virtual reality offering a 360\u00b0 vision, and changes your point of view on disabilities.\nAnswer simple questions to keep the game going.\nUse a Google Cardboard virtual reality headset for an optimal experience.\nYou can also enjoy Appility without a headset, using the panoramic mode.\nAvailable languages: Arabic, Dutch, English, French, Polish,  Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Portuguese.", "short_description": "Appility allows you to experience in VR situations encountered at work by people with disabilities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "publisher_name": "Orange SA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommende